      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T17:14:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question! I had found `errocode` to be too generic and wanted to give it a more descriptive name. Looking at the implementation of `fp_match_success()` I noticed that the input variable was called `match_result` and thought I would reuse it here.\n\nI agree with your comment and `match_errcode` is a more appropriate name.\n\nI\u0027ll let Tom comment on the last part.",
